{
  "_about": "Energy Research Warehouse (ERW) site metadata: which ERW tables hold each ISO's day-ahead and real-time prices, and the main hub or zone the home page shows for each ISO. Table, entity and variable names are exactly those in warehouse/output and Supabase. PJM is absent: its prices are licensed for internal use only (license internal) and never shown on the public site. SPP has no real-time series table in the ERW (docs/platform-tools.md), only the latest interval in latest_prices.",
